  <text id="title" x="58" y="40" width="940" height="46" font="heading" size="30" color="ink" wrap="false">AI-assisted document extraction and review</text>
  <text id="subtitle" x="58" y="86" width="1080" height="30" font="body" size="16" color="muted">The platform uses AI to reduce manual document work while keeping reviewers in control of approval quality and evidence interpretation.</text>
