  <text id="shot-caption" x="82" y="578" width="572" height="18" font="caption" size="12" color="muted" align="center">Real web screenshot: permit detail workflow with AI-assisted extraction, review controls, audit visibility, and approval context</text>
  <table id="ai-table" x="712" y="152" width="510" height="340" columns="2.3,3.7" rows="52,72,72,72,72" font="table" size="15" color="ink" padding="10 12" header-fill="brand" header-border="2 solid brand" border-h="1 solid border" border-v="1 solid border" border-outer="1 solid border">
    <tr color="#FFFFFF"><td>AI capability</td><td>Practical reviewer value</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>PDF and image parsing</strong></td><td>Uploaded permit documents can be read and transformed into structured intake values.</td></tr>
    <tr fill="surface"><td><strong>Form prefilling</strong></td><td>Reviewers and applicants spend less time retyping routine details and more time checking quality.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><strong>Side-by-side verification</strong></td><td>Extracted values can be checked against the original evidence instead of being accepted blindly.</td></tr>
